cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "QUEBRA"
abstract: >-
  A reliability-statistics toolkit for qubit quality time series. It carves
  threshold-excursion durations out of a metric record and applies survival and
  repairable-systems statistics to them, with every figure traceable to the
  content hashes of the data and code that produced it.
type: software
authors:
